<title>ANTIGUA AND BARBUDA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA 64-1 IN 2ND INNS V LEEWARD ISLANDS - TEA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA 64-1 IN 2ND INNS V LEEWARD ISLANDS - TEA.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOHN'S, Antigua 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka, 44 runs ahead on first innings, were 64 for one in their second innings at tea on the second day of the three-day tour match against the Leeward Islands on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: Sri Lanka 192-6 declared and 64-1. Leeward Islands 148 (M.Muralitharan 4-34).</p>
